格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"JARVIS is an intelligent layer that gives agents access to their code, knowledge, context, memory, tools, and runtime — starting locally on your machine, with the ability to extend into the cloud.","id":"gh:1311694293","install_available":false,"language":"Python","name":"jarvis","slug":"phuongddx/jarvis","topics":["claude-code","code-intelligence","code-search","developer-tools","dsh-plugin","mcp","mcp-server","model-context-protocol","python","scip","zoekt"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"JARVIS is an intelligent layer that gives agents access to their code, knowledge, context, memory, t"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"ools, and runtime — starting locally on your machine, with the ability to extend into the cloud."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# jarvis"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"**Your coding agent should not spend its context window on grep.**"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"When your agent asks *\"where is `AuthService` used?\"*, grep returns comments,\nmarkdown, test fixture"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"s, and similarly named symbols in one noisy pile. The\nagent burns context re-reading files to filter"},{"id":"p4s3","text":" signal from noise — and still\nmisses call sites."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"jarvis precomputes a local code-intelligence layer so your agent calls\n`findReferences` for exact oc"},{"id":"p5s2","text":"currences, `goToDefinition` for the defining\nrange, `callHierarchy` for call paths, and `searchCode`"},{"id":"p5s3","text":" for precise lexical\nsearch — **ten MCP tools** for Claude Code, Cursor, or any MCP client.\nYour cod"},{"id":"p5s4","text":"e and indexes never leave your machine."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"| **Without jarvis** | Grep → comments, tests, imports mixed with real hits → opens files to filter "},{"id":"p6s2","text":"→ guesses at call sites → burns context on search instead of reasoning |\n| **With jarvis** | `findRe"},{"id":"p6s3","text":"ferences(\"AuthService\")` → exact file-and-range occurrences → `callHierarchy` for the graph → `searc"},{"id":"p6s4","text":"hCode(\"token refresh\")` → answers without opening every match |"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"Quick start · MCP tools · Dashboard · Limits · Details · Docs"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"## Quick start"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"**1. Install the standalone binary:**"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"Linux users need Homebrew/Linuxbrew\ninstalled first. The formula supports macOS arm64/x86_64 and Lin"},{"id":"p11s2","text":"ux\narm64/x86_64, installs both `jarvis` and `jarvis-server`, and embeds Python\n3.12, dashboard asset"},{"id":"p11s3","text":"s, tree-sitter libraries, `watch`, `scip`,\n`zoekt-git-index`, and `zoekt-webserver`. Homebrew suppli"},{"id":"p11s4","text":"es\n`universal-ctags`. No Python, uv, pip, or PyPI installation is required."},{"id":"p12s1","text":"Upgrade with `brew upgrade jarvis`; recover a damaged installation with\n`brew reinstall jarvis`."},{"id":"p13s1","text":"**2. Index a repo** (slug defaults to the directory name):"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"**3. Register the MCP server:**"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"Ask your agent *\"find all references to `AuthService`\"* — it calls\n`findReferences` instead of grepp"},{"id":"p17s2","text":"your agent *\"find all references to `AuthService`\"* — it calls\n`findReferences` instead of grepping."},{"id":"p18s1","text":"Other MCP clients (Cursor, Claude Desktop, any stdio client)"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"If your client can't find `jarvis-server` on `PATH` (GUI apps often don't\ninherit your shell's), use"},{"id":"p20s2","text":" the absolute path from `which jarvis-server`."},{"id":"p21s1","text":"Claude Code plugin (registers MCP + ships agent skills)"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"Install the Homebrew binary first. The plugin adds jarvis skills and can\nregister the already-instal"},{"id":"p22s2","text":"led `jarvis-server`."},{"id":"p23s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"Optional language indexers"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"The standalone package includes the SCIP converter and both Zoekt binaries.\nThe Homebrew formula doe"},{"id":"p25s2","text":"s not install `setup.sh`; from a jarvis source\ncheckout, install the optional per-language indexer f"},{"id":"p25s3","text":" `setup.sh`; from a jarvis source\ncheckout, install the optional per-language indexer for your repo:"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"| Language | Installer | Toolchain |"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"| TypeScript/TSX | `sh setup.sh --only scip-typescript` | Node.js/npm |\n| Python | `sh setup.sh --on"},{"id":"p27s2","text":"ly scip-python` | Node.js/npm |\n| Java/Kotlin | `sh setup.sh --only scip-java` | JDK; Kotlin repos r"},{"id":"p27s3","text":"equire Kotlin 2.2.0 exactly |\n| Swift | `sh setup.sh --only scip-swift` | Xcode on macOS arm64 |"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"For Maven-built Java repositories on macOS, also install a modern Bash with\n`brew install bash`, the"},{"id":"p28s2","text":"n run `sh setup.sh --only bash-shim` from that same\nsource checkout. Reindex after adding an indexer"},{"id":"p28s3","text":". Without the matching\nindexer, `documentSymbols` and `goToDefinition` still work via Tree-sitter\n[该"},{"id":"p28s4","text":"out the matching\nindexer, `documentSymbols` and `goToDefinition` still work via Tree-sitter\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"## MCP tools"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"| Tool | What it does |"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"| `goToDefinition` | Resolve a symbol to its defining file and range |\n| `findReferences` | Every oc"},{"id":"p31s2","text":"currence of a symbol across the indexed repo |\n| `callHierarchy` | Incoming/outgoing calls for a sym"},{"id":"p31s3","text":"bol |\n| `typeHierarchy` | Supertypes/subtypes |\n| `documentSymbols` | Outline of every symbol define"},{"id":"p31s4","text":"d in one file |\n| `searchCode` | Zoekt lexical/regex search, optionally filtered to one repo |\n| `se"},{"id":"p31s5","text":"manticSearch` | Returns the Homebrew distribution's semantic-unavailability error |\n| `blastRadius` "},{"id":"p31s6","text":"| Which other indexed repos depend on a package, up to 2 hops |\n| `getIndexStatus` | Published commi"},{"id":"p31s7","text":"t, freshness, staleness vs. working tree |\n| `indexRepo` | Build an index for a git repo at `path` |"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"## Dashboard"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"A localhost web console over the same `~/.jarvis` data the CLI and MCP server read:"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"## Requirements and limits"},{"id":"p36s1","text":"- **macOS arm64/x86_64 and Linux arm64/x86_64 only.** Windows is not supported.\n- **Semantic search "},{"id":"p36s2","text":"is unavailable** in the Homebrew distribution.\n- **One language per repo** — detected by extension p"},{"id":"p36s3","text":"lurality across git-tracked files; override with `--language`.\n- **jarvis never edits code.** It is "},{"id":"p36s4","text":"the retrieval half — Serena complements it for renames/refactors.\n- **Indexing is explicit** — run `"},{"id":"p36s5","text":"jarvis index` (or `jarvis watch`) before querying."},{"id":"p37s1","text":"## Details"},{"id":"p38s1","text":"How it works"},{"id":"p39s1","text":"One indexing CLI writes precomputed indexes into `~/.jarvis`; one stdio\nruntime reads them down. The"},{"id":"p39s2","text":" two share no other contract."},{"id":"p40s1","text":"- **Publishing is atomic** — a reindex writes a new snapshot, then flips the `current` pointer via `"},{"id":"p40s2","text":"os.replace`. A query reading the old snapshot keeps working; no downtime window.\n- **The runtime pat"},{"id":"p40s3","text":"h never writes** — every query opens the published snapshot read-only (`mode=ro&immutable=1`).\n- **T"},{"id":"p40s4","text":"he package graph is rebuilt, not accumulated** — each reindex clears that repo's outgoing edges befo"},{"id":"p40s5","text":"h is rebuilt, not accumulated** — each reindex clears that repo's outgoing edges before recomputing."},{"id":"p41s1","text":"Full detail: `docs/system-architecture.md`"},{"id":"p42s1","text":"Indexing CLI reference"},{"id":"p43s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p44s1","text":"Known upstream limitations"},{"id":"p45s1","text":"- **`scip-java` can't index Android/Gradle repos** — its Gradle plugin keys off standard source sets"},{"id":"p45s2","text":" that AGP replaces (scip-java#177). Detected automatically; degrades to search-only.\n- **Kotlin inde"},{"id":"p45s3","text":"xing requires an exact Kotlin version match** — `scip-kotlinc` is compiled against one pinned releas"},{"id":"p45s4","text":"e (currently `2.2.0`). Detected automatically.\n[该节后续省略]"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
